This repository contains research code developed as part of a graduate thesis titled:

"Predicting Clinical Outcomes and Assessing the Effects of Compliance to Diabetes Care Guidelines in Hospitals Using Time-Dependent Machine Learning Methods"
by Shahar Oded, Ben-Gurion University of the Negev.

